# CampusPin Showdown runs with ZERO keys: the basemap is NASA's free night imagery and
# there is no backend. Everything below is optional. Copy this file to
# `.env.local` (gitignored) to set any of them locally; in production they come
# from repo Variables (see docs/OPERATIONS.md).
#
# NOTE: Vite only exposes vars prefixed with VITE_ to the browser, and every
# VITE_ value ships in the public client bundle — none of these are secrets.

# ── Optional page-view analytics ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon token (public). Create a site under Cloudflare
# dashboard → Web Analytics and paste its token here. Cookieless — no consent
# banner needed. Leave blank to disable (e.g. local dev).
VITE_CF_BEACON_TOKEN=
